</ul><h1>Nice & Simple</h1><p><strong>What they feature</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>A part that’s a light.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>A sticky part.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Sticky part refills.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr />
<p><strong>How they work</strong></p>
<ol>
<li>
<p>You plug the light in.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>The light turns on.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>The bugs fly towards the light.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>They get stuck in the sticky part.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>When the sticky part gets covered with bugs, you throw it away.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Put another sticky part in.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Repeat steps 5 and 6 as necessary.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr />
